!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
"Attr A Data Type"         FTA     NULL        ASL1    DBF_GBLCHOICE   YES 2   0   GBL_FTYPE               1   VAR HSV     CON 4
"Attr B Data Type"         FTB     NULL        ASL1    DBF_GBLCHOICE   YES 2   0   GBL_FTYPE               1   VAR HSV     CON 4
"Attr C Data Type"         FTC     NULL        ASL1    DBF_GBLCHOICE   YES 2   0   GBL_FTYPE               1   VAR HSV     CON 4
